 la pantalla azul de Megacable (`com.dotscreen.megacable.portal`), el proceso persistente `Megacable Core` (`com.dotscreen.megacable.core`), `Megacable Updater` (`com.expway.ewm.service`), y todos los servicios OTA/telemetría de ZTE (`com.z\n<truncated 2136 bytes>\nup.exe` o el instalador oficial de drivers Amlogic `InstallDriver.exe`.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Organización Interna de tu Carpeta [programa perfecto](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto)\n\n- **[PROGRAMA_PERFECTO_XVIEW_B866V2.bat](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/PROGRAMA_PERFECTO_XVIEW_B866V2.bat)** — Ejecutable principal.\n- **[LEEME_GUIA_PROGRAMA_PERFECTO.md](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/LEEME_GUIA_PROGRAMA_PERFECTO.md)** — Guía rápida de uso.\n- **[1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR)** — Contiene `adb.exe`, `fastboot_moderno.exe`, `fastboot.exe`, `adnl.exe`, `update.exe`, `mke2fs.exe` y [MOTOR_PROGRAMA_PERFECTO.ps1](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR/MOTOR_PROGRAMA_PERFECTO.ps1).\n- **[2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV)** — Contiene los 11 APKs verificados (`Home_Screen_Launcher_1.1.3.apk`, `TVLauncher_4_GoogleTV.apk`, `Button_Mapper_Pro_2.54.apk`, `autostart.apk`, `Filemanager.apk`, `Downloader_2.0.4.apk`, `signMagisTV_APS-MUTO.apk`, `xuper_hydra.apk`, `Hdplay.apk`, `DLStore.apk`, `AppDMC.apk`).\n- **[3_LLAVES_USB_PARA_LA_CAJA](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/3_LLAVES_USB_PARA_LA_CAJA)** — Contiene `QADEBUG.ini`, `QADEBUGTOOL.ini`, `logconfig.ini`, `factory_update_param.aml`, `usb_left.txt` y `usb_right.txt`.\n- **[4_DRIVERS_Y_GUI_WINDOWS](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/4_DRIVERS_Y_GUI_WINDOWS)** — Contiene `ADBAppControl-1.8.6-setup.exe` y la carpeta `WorldCup_Driver_VID_1B8E`.\n- **[5_FIRMWARE_SEGURO_B866V2](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/5_FIRMWARE_SEGURO_B866V2)** — Contiene las particiones verificadas de `ZTE B866V2` + `cache_ext4.img` + `recovery.img` desbloqueado (sin `factory.img` ni `cri_data.img`).","thinking":"The absence of PowerShell parser errors indicates a different issue. The user's request to \"put it in the folder called program\" suggests a desired location, either on a USB drive (D:\\KINGSTON) or in the specified desktop folder path, which requires a check for the existence of the specific target folders.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
